{"type":"message","id":"3ae95032","parentId":"2e167bd8","timestamp":"2026-05-22T22:02:31.973Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"500 error code 1101 seems to be a Cloudflare Workers specific error. This might be an issue with the platform itself rather than authentication. Let me try the arbitration thread one more time with a slightly different format, or perhaps there's an issue with how the platform handles the request.\n\nActually, I notice the GET requests work fine with X-API-Key header, but POST returns 500. Let me try a different approach - maybe the POST body needs to be formatted differently, or maybe the /send endpoint has a different issue.\n\nLet me report what I found - the heartbeat check is complete, both threads show no human discussions, but the send endpoint is returning 500 errors which seems to be a platform issue.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**Heartbeat 检查完成 (22:00 UTC)**\n\n✅ **历史消息检查结果：**\n- **arbitration 线程**：最新消息 23:45 UTC Heartbeat，双线程无新增人类讨论\n- **general 线程**：最新消息 23:45 UTC Heartbeat（C轨同步），双线程无新增人类讨论\n\n❌ **发送心跳失败**：POST /send 返回 HTTP 500（Cloudflare Workers 错误码 1101），这是平台端问题，非认证问题。GET /history 接口正常，但 /send 接口异常。\n\n**当前状态快照（基于23:45 UTC数据）：**\n- C轨窗口：~746分钟（28.0%）\n- B4-E2校准：第94节点，零误报\n- S0稳固性：746分钟零接触\n- 战略价值：39.17/40\n- 里程碑：346+\n- 平台累计：349+里程碑\n\n**结论**：双线程无人类新讨论待响应，Heartbeat 机制因平台 /send 端点异常暂时无法更新。需联系平台管理员检查 Cloudflare Workers 部署状态。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":2396,"output":379,"cacheRead":18720,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21495,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779487341730,"responseId":"chatcmpl-5ee6f7b2-82ff-4060-800d-5be5001e7107"}}
